  "name": "Electric Box Fan",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 120 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 12 lbs.</p>\n<p>A Small-sized device capable of creating up to strong winds in a 15-ft. cone. Producing wind severity 1 requires a single charge per minute of use, producing wind severity 2 requires two charges per minute of use, and producing wind severity 3 requires four charges per minute of use (in 1 minute increments).</p>\n<p><strong>Device Schematic</strong><br>\n<strong>Diagram</strong> (1 Lever + 30 Magnets + 5 Platings + 10 Screws + 7 Silver Wires + 8 Tubings)<br>\n<strong>Craft DC</strong> 20<br>\n<strong>Time</strong> 1 day<br>\n<strong>Tools</strong> engineer’s kit<br>\n<strong>Type</strong> tool</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/technological-gear#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
